<title>CHILE: TABLE-Chile's Andina H1 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Chile's Andina H1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean bottler Embotelladora Andina SA reported the following individual results for the first half of the year.</p>
<p>				 H1 1997	   H1 1996</p>
<p>Net earnings		   18.41	     22.01</p>
<p>Operating profit	     15.51	     14.04</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	  5.21	     10.14</p>
<p>Revenues			 70.46	     59.19</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
